External model components (not stored in this Git repository)
-------------------------------------------------------------
  FunASR — https://github.com/modelscope/FunASR
      Runtime ASR dependency.

  CAM++ (via FunASR / ModelScope) — https://www.modelscope.cn/
      Runtime speaker-embedding model.

  OmniVoice model weights — https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice
      Runtime TTS model weights.

  Model weights must be obtained and distributed separately under their
  applicable upstream terms. The Apache-2.0 license for this repository does
  not grant rights to third-party model weights.

  Reference-voice audio and matching transcripts are also not distributed in
  this Git repository. Operators must provide assets they are authorized to use.

